# Licensing and Third-Party Game Assets Notice

## Dyson Sphere Program assets

*Dyson Sphere Program* was developed by Youthcat Studio and is published by
Gamirror Games. Copyright and all other intellectual-property rights in
*Dyson Sphere Program*, including its names, logos, icons, images, textures,
and other game assets, remain with Youthcat Studio and/or their applicable
rights holders. All rights are reserved by those rights holders.

The unmodified game assets included in this repository, including the files
under `assets/DSP_exported assets/`, are used with the publisher's express,
limited permission for the DSP Practical Progression Guide and its related DSP
Guide Check mod materials as the non-commercial community project described in
the permission request.

That permission does not transfer ownership of the game assets and must not be
understood as a general license to modify them, use them commercially,
redistribute them as a standalone asset collection, sublicense them, or use
them in unrelated projects. Anyone wishing to use those assets outside the
permitted project must obtain any necessary permission directly from the
applicable rights holders.

The privacy-sanitized permission record is preserved at
`docs/management/game-asset-use-permission-sanitized.md`. The original email is
held privately by the project owner and is not included in this repository.

